{"unit_id":"PanChengN__dsh-plugin-session-move#card-zh","repo":"PanChengN/dsh-plugin-session-move","commit":"b9936b79de303e387d6772f9638e0748e958eeda","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-session-move 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话迁移插件，可把一段对话从当前工作区移到另一个工作区。它在侧栏会话菜单加入「移动到工作区」入口，并提供选择目标工作区的对话框；也注册 move_session_to_workspace 工具和 POST 主机端点。迁移时会移动会话日志目录、更新日志 header 中的工作目录并调整工作区归属，兼顾暂存恢复与失败回滚。适合需要整理项目对话归属的 DSH 用户；无需 API Key 或外部服务，目标工作区目录须存在。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:28-30","client.js:351-371","client.js:373-385","index.js:37-53","index.js:640-707"]}
{"unit_id":"PanChengN__dsh-plugin-session-move#card-en","repo":"PanChengN/dsh-plugin-session-move","commit":"b9936b79de303e387d6772f9638e0748e958eeda","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-session-move adds workspace moves to DSH web. Choose a destination from the sidebar menu, or request a move with an agent tool. It relocates the session log and updates its directory header and workspace membership. No API key or external service is needed; the destination must exist.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:28-30","client.js:351-385","index.js:37-53","index.js:640-707"]}
