{"unit_id":"PanChengN__dsh-plugin-session-move#feature-1","repo":"PanChengN/dsh-plugin-session-move","commit":"b9936b79de303e387d6772f9638e0748e958eeda","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-session-move 的功能「侧栏移动会话」：在会话菜单提供移动入口，打开目标工作区选择对话框。选择工作区并确认后，客户端向主机端点提交会话与目标工作区标识。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:351-385","client.js:425-437"]}
{"unit_id":"PanChengN__dsh-plugin-session-move#feature-2","repo":"PanChengN/dsh-plugin-session-move","commit":"b9936b79de303e387d6772f9638e0748e958eeda","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-session-move 的功能「迁移会话日志」：主机端将会话目录暂存后移入目标工作区对应目录，并改写日志 header 的 cwd；后续事件内容保持原样。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:232-263","index.js:640-665"]}
{"unit_id":"PanChengN__dsh-plugin-session-move#feature-3","repo":"PanChengN/dsh-plugin-session-move","commit":"b9936b79de303e387d6772f9638e0748e958eeda","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-session-move 的功能「更新工作区归属」：迁移日志后更新注册表索引，并把会话从原工作区解绑、附加到目标工作区，使侧栏归属同步更新。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:667-707"]}
{"unit_id":"PanChengN__dsh-plugin-session-move#feature-4","repo":"PanChengN/dsh-plugin-session-move","commit":"b9936b79de303e387d6772f9638e0748e958eeda","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-session-move 的功能「Agent 调用迁移」：注册 move_session_to_workspace 工具，供 Agent 指定会话和目标工作区；目标可按工作区 id、标题或绝对路径解析。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:332-350","index.js:37-53"]}
{"unit_id":"PanChengN__dsh-plugin-session-move#caveat-1","repo":"PanChengN/dsh-plugin-session-move","commit":"b9936b79de303e387d6772f9638e0748e958eeda","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-session-move 使用前须知：目标工作区目录必须存在；会话正在运行时需等当前轮次结束后才能迁移。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:543-549","index.js:562-564"]}
